                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Why did I decide to fully 100% this hentai visual novel game? Because I wanted to. That's why. Okay, in all seriousness why did I even decided to pick this game out of the other Sakura title games? Well I have a bit of history with this game. I first pirated it on my phone off a sketch ass website and (not) suprisingly sunk a bit of time into \"playing\" the game. So I have already experienced this game and have moved on, but I decided to purchase the game as a joke as how most porn games are bought.\n\nThe story of Sakura Nova is pretty trope heavy and obviously not very good, but if you are critiqing the story of a hentai visual novel especially one from the Sakura series, I would imagine that you have made reviewing these types of games your whole personality. Please go outside and maybe learn how to socialise. The art however is really really well done. Although I do wish that the scenes were slightly animated, but I can't ask for much since this game is dirt cheap anyway. Even then the voice acting (WHICH IS ACTUALLY CRAZY) did the job anyway...\n\nIn terms of \"gameplay\", there really isn't much. As you will probably be playing with one hand anyway. Just pick some dialog options and you get a ending with one, or even both of the girls. Pretty cut and dry here.\n\nSpeaking of the girls here, I think that they are both very nice in their own way. I personally prefer the serious Kaguya, hell I would do anything for someone like her gulp... ANYWAY! I can also see why people would gravitate to the family oriented Arisa. But once again, this game is pretty easy to guess what might happen next, but we ain't playing for that right? We, YES WE! Are all playing for Kaguya and her lace pyjamas! Bro, holy shit the artist cooked when it came to her outfits! The artist is just another me. LIKE GRAHHH LET ME ATTEM!!! Ok, I'll stop.\n\nAchievements are pretty simple and easy to get. Hell it only took me 40 minutes to complete this game... But you can definitely get this done even quicker if you want to or not. You do have to play through the game at least 3 times, but that's a walk in the park as you can just skip all the dialog and just punch in the correct answers to get each ending.\n\nThere really isn't much to talk about this game. As we all know that we are NOT playing this for the story or achievements. So yeah. Best girl is Kaguya and I hope you \"enjoy\" this game. If you can even call it a game lmao.\n\n10/10 (because of the lace pyjamas)",
